<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>跨节点协调 —— 前提是单个 agent 是受控的</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", gap: 20}}><Box style={{height: 300, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 4}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 A</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 B</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 C</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 26, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}>↓</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 D（内嵌 loop）</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 E</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 88, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>节点 F</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "center", marginTop: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>显式节点　·　显式边　·　显式状态</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 212, flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Graph 可以编排</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>loop</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>也可以编排</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>工具与验证器</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>〔边界〕节点各自失控时</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>编排只是把错误放大</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>10 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
